        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we advance our efforts to educate various sectors about the implementation of SteraMist iHP and the adoption of our handheld equipment in schools, transportation, and hospitality as standard protocols, we are witnessing an integration of our service providers, primarily from the commercial division, with our Life Sciences division.",
